Actually, this approach with string markers is not clean and might fail with certain types. Let me use a better approach:

```js
function findDuplicates(arr) {
    const seen = new Set();
    const duplicates = [];

    for (const item of arr) {
        if (seen.has(item)) {
            // Only add to duplicates if it's the second time we're seeing this item
            // and we haven't already added it to duplicates
